---
description: Require every change to be made on a new branch and delivered via pull request, never directly on master
alwaysApply: true
---

# Branch per change

- Before starting any new piece of work, create a descriptively named branch (`feat/...`, `fix/...`, `chore/...`) off the up-to-date default branch (`master`).
- Never commit directly to `master`.
- Deliver every change through a pull request.
- Cloud agents use the `cursor/<descriptive-name>-<suffix>` branch naming required by their environment.
